function renderHistory(){const p=profile(),q=$('historySearch').value.trim();$('styleVersionSelect').innerHTML=(db.styleVersions||[]).map(v=>'<option value="'+v.version+'">風格 v'+v.version+' · '+esc(localDate(v.createdAt))+'</option>').reverse().join('');$('styleRestore').disabled=!(db.styleVersions||[]).length;$('styleActive').textContent=p.approvedVersion?'目前採用風格 v'+p.approvedVersion:'目前採用自動分析，尚未確認風格版本';renderStyleMetrics(p);$('profile').textContent=`風格樣本：${p.count} 則\n人工修訂學習：${p.edits} 筆\n平均字數：${p.features.averageLength} 字；直接稱呼：${p.features.usesDirectAddress} 則；發展性期待：${p.features.usesExpectation} 則\n偏好用詞：${p.preferred.join('、')||'尚未建立'}`;$('historyList').innerHTML=db.history.map((h,i)=>({h,i})).filter(({h})=>!q||[h.source,h.name,h.studentId,h.comment].some(v=>String(v||'').includes(q))).map(({h,i})=>`<div class="historyItem"><small class="muted">${esc([h.source,h.seat,h.name].filter(Boolean).join(' · '))}</small><p>${esc(h.comment)}</p><label>核對學號 <input data-history-id="${i}" value="${esc(h.studentId||'')}" placeholder="未連結"></label></div>`).join('');}
$('historySearch').oninput=renderHistory;$('styleReview').onclick=()=>{$('styleWords').value=profile().preferred.join('、');$('styleEditor').hidden=false;};$('styleApprove').onclick=()=>{try{db.styleVersions=saveStyleVersion(db.styleVersions||[],$('styleWords').value);save();renderHistory();$('styleEditor').hidden=true;toast('已儲存教師風格版本');}catch(e){toast(e.message);}};$('styleCancel').onclick=()=>{$('styleEditor').hidden=true;};$('styleRestore').onclick=()=>{const n=Number($('styleVersionSelect').value),v=(db.styleVersions||[]).find(x=>x.version===n);if(v&&confirm('以此舊版偏好建立一個新版本？原版本仍保留。')){db.styleVersions=saveStyleVersion(db.styleVersions,v.preferred.join('、'));save();renderHistory();}};$('historyList').addEventListener('change',e=>{if(!e.target.hasAttribute('data-history-id'))return;try{if(!confirm('請確認此學號確實屬於該歷史評語學生。')){renderHistory();return;}db.history=matchHistoricalId(db.history,Number(e.target.dataset.historyId),e.target.value);save();renderHistory();}catch(err){toast(err.message);renderHistory();}});
$('addHistory').onclick=async()=>{try{const file=$('historyFile').files[0];let entries;if(file&&/\.(xlsx|csv|docx)$/i.test(file.name)){entries=historyEntries(await recordsFrom(file),file.name);}else{const raw=file?await readText(file):$('historyText').value;entries=raw.split(/\r?\n/).map(comment=>({comment:comment.trim(),studentId:'',source:file?.name||'手動輸入'}));}const rejected=entries.filter(x=>length(x.comment.trim())<20).length;entries=entries.filter(x=>length(x.comment.trim())>=20);const before=db.history.length;db.history=mergeHistory(db.history,entries);save();renderHistory();$('historyText').value='';$('historyFile').value='';toast(`新增 ${db.history.length-before} 則歷史評語，略過空白或重複資料；不足 20 字 ${rejected} 則`);}catch(e){toast(e.message);}};
function localDate(value=Date.now()){return new Intl.DateTimeFormat('sv-SE',{timeZone:'Asia/Taipei',year:'numeric',month:'2-digit',day:'2-digit'}).format(new Date(value));}
